  "content": "<h2>XaeroZoomout</h2><p>将<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fNcUtCpym\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero的世界地图</a>的最小缩放比例从0.0625倍降低到0.0025倍。</p><h3>功能</h3><p>无需设置，无需配置；只需缩小并观察其效果。</p><p>作为参考，Xaero的世界地图在完全缩小时通常显示约30k方块宽的区域。使用此模组后，显示宽度增加到约760k。</p><p>注意：渲染世界地图对CPU的负担较大，因此在完全缩小时可能会遇到一些卡顿。</p><h3>许可证</h3><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.apache.org%252flicenses%252fLICENSE-2.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apache-2.0</a></p><h3>联系</h3><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fterminalmc.dev%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1103153365216669797?logo=discord&amp;label=Discord服务器&amp;color=#5865F2\" alt=\"Discord服务器\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/TerminalMC/XaeroZoomout/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/TerminalMC/XaeroZoomout?logo=github&amp;label=GitHub问题\" alt=\"GitHub问题\"></a></p>",
